    "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n  <p class=\"eyebrow\">Impact</p>\n  <h2 class=\"slide-title\">Structured prompts cut costs, boost consistency, and converge fast</h2>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:18px;\">\n      <thead><tr><th style=\"padding:12px 24px;text-align:left;background:#7C2D12;color:#FFF7ED;font-size:13px;\">Dimension</th><th style=\"padding:12px 24px;text-align:left;background:#7C2D12;color:#FFF7ED;font-size:13px;\">Gain</th><th style=\"padding:12px 24px;text-align:left;background:#7C2D12;color:#FFF7ED;font-size:13px;\">Measured against</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">Token cost</td><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">30–50% fewer tokens per request</td><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">naive prompts</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">Output consistency</td><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">up to 40% gain</td><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">few-shot + chain-of-thought vs. none</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">Iteration</td><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">3–5 revision rounds</td><td style=\"padding:12px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #FED7AA;color:#431407;\">reaching production-grade quality</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"callout\">The gains from structured prompting are large and well-documented.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"slide-footer\"><span>Meridian</span><span>3</span></div>\n</section>\n",
